    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vastophobia is a new game about exploring liminal and strange space's , focusing on atmosphere and mild threats (no jump scares here). Find out why you are here. where is your family. make your way through varied and disturbing environments.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558470/extras/78c8892515200554515063eb90a06302.avif?t=1745616475\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tools to evade enemies. no jump scares. you will always be able to see or hear the threats first</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558470/extras/00daf410290785f144035bb1190bac06.avif?t=1745616475\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World Story , follow how you arrived here. what happened to you and where is your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558470/extras/772f5dc37393cbc2f45626f3f60741f6.avif?t=1745616475\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vastophbia is an early access game which focus's on atmosphere and soundscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >venture into the strange world of the In-Between and try to return to your family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music By\u00a0Scott Buckley - Composer</p>",
